### What I saw

The Agent integration lane's dependencies (a Runtime checkout, the lifecycle checkout) are not provisioned, so the lane errors at setup unless you know the environment variables. Plan 50 RB-1 already names this work; Plan 39 AT1.4 covers the lifecycle variable for the unit shards.

Source: Release 13 live and offline runs, 11–12 Nov (smell 13) (interim file `observations/2026-11-12-integration-lane-dependencies-unprovisioned.md`, 2026-11-12)

### About

Plan 50; Plan 39
